                    "#* This will hold onto your filament, which is the part of the bulb that actually lights up.",
                    "#Cut the iron wire into 1-1/2 to 2 inch (3.8cm to 5cm) strips. Make five strips. The thinner your wire is before beginning, the better. Thinner wire will almost always result in a better light.[[Image:Make a Light Bulb Step 15 Version 4.jpg|center]]",
                    "#* Use a pair of good wire cutters for this.",
