                    "#Cut the iron wire into 1-1/2 to 2 inch (3.8cm to 5cm) strips. Make five strips. The thinner your wire is before beginning, the better. Thinner wire will almost always result in a better light.[[Image:Make a Light Bulb Step 7 Version 2.jpg|center]]",
